{"page":31,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"1.3 • 네트위크코어","words":[{"text":"1.3","x":1167,"y":153,"width":39,"height":26},{"text":"•","x":1239,"y":160,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"네트위크코어","x":1284,"y":153,"width":162,"height":30}]},{"text":"23","words":[{"text":"23","x":1777,"y":143,"width":46,"height":36}]},{"text":"10 Mbps 이더넷","words":[{"text":"10","x":406,"y":319,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"Mbps","x":448,"y":319,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"이더넷","x":539,"y":319,"width":78,"height":29}]},{"text":"15 Mbps","words":[{"text":"15","x":920,"y":516,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"Mbps","x":962,"y":515,"width":77,"height":32}]},{"text":"출력 링크를 기다리는","words":[{"text":"출력","x":693,"y":611,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"링크를","x":755,"y":613,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"기다리는","x":844,"y":613,"width":103,"height":30}]},{"text":"패킷 큐","words":[{"text":"패킷","x":691,"y":652,"width":52,"height":28},{"text":"큐","x":753,"y":652,"width":26,"height":28}]},{"text":"``패킷","words":[{"text":"``패킷","x":274,"y":907,"width":129,"height":50}]},{"text":"그림 1 .12 • 패킷 스위칭(흑은 교환)","words":[{"text":"그림","x":169,"y":992,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"1","x":238,"y":993,"width":10,"height":27},{"text":".12","x":259,"y":993,"width":47,"height":28},{"text":"•","x":321,"y":998,"width":15,"height":14},{"text":"패킷","x":351,"y":991,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"스위칭(흑은","x":417,"y":990,"width":151,"height":32},{"text":"교환)","x":577,"y":990,"width":66,"height":31}]},{"text":"넷 링크를 통해 패킷을 전송한다. 라우터는 다음에 이들 패킷을 15 Mbps의 링크로 전","words":[{"text":"넷","x":172,"y":1135,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"링크를","x":219,"y":1134,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"통해","x":330,"y":1133,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"패킷을","x":412,"y":1133,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"전송한다.","x":527,"y":1133,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"라우터는","x":686,"y":1133,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"다음에","x":835,"y":1133,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"이들","x":953,"y":1133,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":1035,"y":1133,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"15","x":1154,"y":1138,"width":32,"height":29},{"text":"Mbps의","x":1202,"y":1134,"width":117,"height":41},{"text":"링크로","x":1338,"y":1134,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"전","x":1450,"y":1135,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"달한다. 만약에 짧은 기간 동안에 라우터에 도착하는 패킷의 전송속도가 (bps로 변환","words":[{"text":"달한다.","x":171,"y":1193,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"만약에","x":296,"y":1193,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"짧은","x":412,"y":1193,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"기간","x":496,"y":1193,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"동안에","x":576,"y":1193,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"라우터에","x":694,"y":1193,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"도착하는","x":845,"y":1193,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"패킷의","x":1000,"y":1193,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"전송속도가","x":1120,"y":1194,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"(bps로","x":1302,"y":1197,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"변환","x":1418,"y":1194,"width":65,"height":36}]},{"text":"했을 때) 15 Mbps를 초과하면 라우터에서 혼잡이 발생하게 되고 링크로 전송되기 전","words":[{"text":"했을","x":172,"y":1254,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"때)","x":253,"y":1253,"width":42,"height":38},{"text":"15","x":315,"y":1257,"width":32,"height":28},{"text":"Mbps를","x":363,"y":1255,"width":123,"height":39},{"text":"초과하면","x":500,"y":1254,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"라우터에서","x":650,"y":1254,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡이","x":834,"y":1253,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"발생하게","x":952,"y":1254,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"되고","x":1106,"y":1254,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"링크로","x":1189,"y":1254,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"전송되기","x":1303,"y":1254,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"전","x":1450,"y":1254,"width":30,"height":37}]},{"text":"에 링크의 출력 버퍼에 큐잉된다. 예를 들어, 호스트 A와 B가 각각 동시에 연속해서","words":[{"text":"에","x":172,"y":1313,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"링크의","x":221,"y":1313,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"출력","x":334,"y":1313,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼에","x":418,"y":1313,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"큐잉된다.","x":533,"y":1314,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"예를","x":697,"y":1314,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":779,"y":1313,"width":78,"height":38},{"text":"호스트","x":874,"y":1315,"width":104,"height":30},{"text":"A와","x":992,"y":1314,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"B가","x":1071,"y":1314,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"각각","x":1148,"y":1314,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"동시에","x":1230,"y":1314,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"연속해서","x":1349,"y":1314,"width":128,"height":38}]},{"text":"5개의 패킷을 송신하면, 이들 패킷의 대부분은 큐에서 대기하는 데 시간을 보낼 것이","words":[{"text":"5개의","x":171,"y":1373,"width":82,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":273,"y":1373,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"송신하면,","x":386,"y":1373,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"이들","x":547,"y":1374,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"패킷의","x":629,"y":1374,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"대부분은","x":747,"y":1374,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"큐에서","x":897,"y":1374,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"대기하는","x":1018,"y":1374,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"데","x":1170,"y":1375,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"시간을","x":1219,"y":1375,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"보낼","x":1334,"y":1375,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"것이","x":1416,"y":1375,"width":61,"height":38}]},{"text":"다. 사실, 이러한 상황은 일상에서 일어나는 상황들과 유사하「卜예를 들어, 은행에서","words":[{"text":"다.","x":172,"y":1434,"width":39,"height":37},{"text":"사실,","x":228,"y":1434,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"이러한","x":320,"y":1434,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"상황은","x":433,"y":1433,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"일상에서","x":551,"y":1434,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"일어나는","x":701,"y":1435,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"상황들과","x":849,"y":1434,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"유사하「卜예를","x":1002,"y":1434,"width":242,"height":38},{"text":"들어,","x":1257,"y":1435,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"은행에서","x":1347,"y":1436,"width":129,"height":38}]},{"text":"줄을 서야 하고 톨게이트에서도 기다려야 한다. 1.4절에서 보다 자세히 이러한 큐잉 지","words":[{"text":"줄을","x":171,"y":1495,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"서야","x":251,"y":1494,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"하고","x":329,"y":1494,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"톨게이트에서도","x":407,"y":1494,"width":237,"height":37},{"text":"기다려야","x":658,"y":1494,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":805,"y":1494,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"1.4절에서","x":898,"y":1494,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"보다","x":1061,"y":1495,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"자세히","x":1143,"y":1495,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"이러한","x":1258,"y":1496,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"큐잉","x":1369,"y":1497,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"지","x":1448,"y":1497,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"연에 대해 살펴볼 것이다.","words":[{"text":"연에","x":174,"y":1555,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"대해","x":252,"y":1555,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"살펴볼","x":329,"y":1555,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":444,"y":1555,"width":107,"height":37}]},{"text":"전달 테이블과 라우팅 프로토콜","words":[{"text":"전달","x":174,"y":1661,"width":70,"height":41},{"text":"테이블과","x":253,"y":1661,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"라우팅","x":403,"y":1660,"width":101,"height":42},{"text":"프로토콜","x":516,"y":1661,"width":142,"height":39}]},{"text":"이전에 라우터는 접속된 통신 링크 중 하나로 도착하는 패킷을 받아서 접속된 통신 링","words":[{"text":"이전에","x":175,"y":1732,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"라우터는","x":287,"y":1732,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"접속된","x":435,"y":1731,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"통신","x":547,"y":1731,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":631,"y":1731,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"중","x":709,"y":1733,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"하나로","x":756,"y":1731,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"도착하는","x":870,"y":1731,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":1022,"y":1732,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"받아서","x":1138,"y":1733,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"접속된","x":1254,"y":1733,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"통신","x":1366,"y":1734,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"링","x":1449,"y":1734,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"크 중 다른 링크로 그 패킷을 전달한다고 했다. 그러나 라우터는 어떻게 그 패킷을 어","words":[{"text":"크","x":173,"y":1798,"width":33,"height":25},{"text":"중","x":221,"y":1794,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":268,"y":1792,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"링크로","x":350,"y":1792,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":464,"y":1796,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"패킷을","x":512,"y":1791,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"전달한다고","x":627,"y":1791,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"했다.","x":810,"y":1790,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":900,"y":1791,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"라우터는","x":1019,"y":1792,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"어떻게","x":1171,"y":1792,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1285,"y":1797,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"패킷을","x":1334,"y":1792,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"어","x":1449,"y":1793,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"느 링크로 전달해야 하는지를 결정하는가? 패킷 전달은 실제 여러 다른 유형의 컴퓨터","words":[{"text":"느","x":173,"y":1858,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"링크로","x":222,"y":1853,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"전달해야","x":334,"y":1852,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"하는지를","x":480,"y":1852,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"결정하는가?","x":629,"y":1851,"width":184,"height":38},{"text":"패킷","x":828,"y":1851,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"전달은","x":909,"y":1851,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"실제","x":1024,"y":1851,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"여러","x":1106,"y":1852,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":1186,"y":1852,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"유형의","x":1266,"y":1852,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1383,"y":1852,"width":94,"height":38}]},{"text":"네트워크에서 다른 방식으로 실행된다. 여기에서 라우팅이 인터넷에서 어떻게 실행되","words":[{"text":"네트워크에서","x":175,"y":1913,"width":196,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":390,"y":1913,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"방식으로","x":471,"y":1913,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"실행된다.","x":620,"y":1912,"width":143,"height":37},{"text":"여기에서","x":781,"y":1912,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"라우팅이","x":931,"y":1912,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"인터넷에서","x":1083,"y":1912,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"어떻게","x":1268,"y":1913,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"실행되","x":1382,"y":1913,"width":97,"height":39}]},{"text":"는지를 간략히 기술한다.","words":[{"text":"는지를","x":173,"y":1975,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"간략히","x":287,"y":1974,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"기술한다.","x":400,"y":1974,"width":142,"height":38}]},{"text":"인터넷에서 모든 종단 시스템은 IP 주소라고 하는 주소를 갖는다. 소스 종단 시스","words":[{"text":"인터넷에서","x":242,"y":2036,"width":161,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":421,"y":2038,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"종단","x":502,"y":2036,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"시스템은","x":584,"y":2034,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"IP","x":733,"y":2040,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"주소라고","x":781,"y":2035,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"하는","x":931,"y":2035,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"주소를","x":1012,"y":2037,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"갖는다.","x":1130,"y":2036,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"소스","x":1254,"y":2038,"width":68,"height":29},{"text":"종단","x":1335,"y":2036,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"시스","x":1417,"y":2036,"width":66,"height":38}]},{"text":"템이 패킷을 목적지 종단 시스템으로 보내고자 할 때, 소스는 패킷의 헤더에 목적지의","words":[{"text":"템이","x":175,"y":2097,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"패킷을","x":256,"y":2097,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"목적지","x":369,"y":2097,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"종단","x":483,"y":2097,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"시스템으로","x":565,"y":2096,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"보내고자","x":749,"y":2097,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"할","x":898,"y":2097,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":948,"y":2097,"width":40,"height":39},{"text":"소스는","x":1003,"y":2099,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"패킷의","x":1120,"y":2097,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"헤더에","x":1235,"y":2097,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"목적지의","x":1348,"y":2098,"width":132,"height":39}]},{"text":"IP 주소를 포함한다. 우편 주소와 마찬가지로 이 주소는 계층적 구조를 갖는다. 패킷이","words":[{"text":"IP","x":173,"y":2163,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"주소를","x":220,"y":2160,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"포함한다.","x":334,"y":2159,"width":143,"height":38},